CORE
trap-verify.sh
--resolve-dynamic-sites
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^Dynamic sites: 1 resolved, 0 unreachable, 0 unresolved \(2 rounds\)$
^\[shell-dynamic-site\.1\] .* the action of trap is one of the candidates of shell-trap:trap-verify.sh:7:1: :, exit 3: SUCCESS$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
other actions are not supported.*: FAILURE
^warning: ignoring
--
Each candidate action of the trap is converted, and runs at exit.
